@startuml compact_database_admission
' Java baseline: 14769188538eaa2f1df1e25ef2fef40d87ceafed
' Source: modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/resources/mapper/session/RuntimeSessionMapper.xml
' Symbols: lockSessionForUpdate, listCurrentBranchEntries, markSessionRunning
' Source: modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/persistence/MyBatisRuntimeSessionRepository.java
' Observed behavior: user events and configuration writes serialize on the Session row.
' Java target added here: observeCompaction and acceptCompaction; not existing pi behavior.
' Design reason: prepare outside the database lock, then reject stale history or configuration.
' pi baseline: 4af9d21d3b4d664e4a29fcabfec85171077248e3
' Source: packages/coding-agent/src/core/agent-session.ts:compact, abortCompaction
' Java divergence: idle-only database admission; no synthetic command lifecycle entries.
title Compact database admission - slice 6b2a
hide footbox
participant "Future Runtime Service\n(6b2b, not delivered here)" as Caller
participant "Repository" as Repo
database "Session + current branch" as DB
Caller -> Repo : observeCompaction(sessionId)
group Observation transaction
  Repo -> DB : SELECT Session FOR UPDATE
  alt missing or running
    DB --> Repo : absent or Session only
  else idle
    loop pages of 500 while full
      Repo -> DB : read current branch after last sequence
      DB --> Repo : ordered entries
    end
  end
end
Repo --> Caller : snapshot (no writes)
note over Caller
Future work: reject busy, detect empty context,
prepare Agent and execution resources.
Empty observation alone is not command completion.
end note
Caller -> Repo : acceptCompaction(observedSession, time)
group Acceptance transaction
  Repo -> DB : SELECT Session FOR UPDATE
  alt missing, busy, or changed leaf/model/thinking
    Repo --> Caller : NOT_FOUND / BUSY (no writes)
  else same context (Name may differ)
    Repo -> DB : mark running; current version + 1
    note right of DB
    Preserve Name and active leaf.
    No Entry, Usage, sequence, or stats writes.
    Require exactly one affected row.
    Roll back on transaction failure.
    end note
    Repo --> Caller : ACCEPTED after commit
  end
end
note over Caller
Future work: connect slice 6b1 and own cleanup.
No public Command or HTTP route in this slice.
end note
@enduml
